OL,3,CManchester's dance-music institute The
OL,4,CWarehouse Project celebrates 20 years
OL,6,FOne of Manchester's most iconic
OL,7,Fnightlife institutions is stepping out
OL,8,Fof the shadows and into the spotlight.
OL,10,FThe Warehouse Project (WHP), which has
OL,11,Fshaped British club culture since
OL,12,F2006, is marking its 20th anniversary
OL,13,Fwith a free outdoor exhibition, "20
OL,14,FYears of The Warehouse Project,"
OL,15,Fbringing the electric energy of the
OL,16,Fdancefloor to the heart of
OL,17,FSpinningfields.
OL,26,@uD@aOUvD@`O]
