OL,3,CManchester's dance-music institute The
OL,4,CWarehouse Project celebrates 20 years
OL,6,FLaunching on Thursday 16th July, the
OL,7,Feight-week exhibition transforms The
OL,8,FAvenue into an open-air gallery,
OL,9,Ffeaturing 20 striking visual works
OL,10,Fthat document WHP's evolution.
OL,12,FFrom its roots at Boddingtons
OL,13,FStrangeways Brewery, through the
OL,14,Flegendary Store Street car park, and
OL,15,Fonto its current home at Depot
OL,16,FMayfield.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
