PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786121302
OL,3,CManchester's dance-music institute The
OL,4,CWarehouse Project celebrates 20 years
OL,6,FThe collection, spanning raw 35mm
OL,7,Ffilm, digital shots, Polaroids, and
OL,8,Frarely seen archival material, offers
OL,9,Fa visual love letter to two decades of
OL,10,FManchester rave culture.
OL,12,FThe exhibition showcases the work of
OL,13,Feight photographers who have
OL,14,Fchronicled WHP's journey over the
OL,15,Fyears, including Sebastian Matthes,
OL,16,FShaun Peckham, Jody Hartley, Anthony
OL,17,FMooney, Rob Jones, Pippa Rankin,
OL,18,FSophia Carey, and Harriet Bols.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
