CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786121302
OL,3,CManchester's dance-music institute The
OL,4,CWarehouse Project celebrates 20 years
OL,6,FTheir images capture everything from
OL,7,Feuphoric crowd scenes and iconic
OL,8,Fperformances to candid backstage
OL,9,Fmoments and the quiet intensity that
OL,10,Fpulses through every WHP season.
OL,12,FAlongside the photography, visitors
OL,13,Fcan trace the evolution of WHP's
OL,14,Finstantly recognisable graphic
OL,15,Fidentity, with original artwork from
OL,16,Fsome of the designers and studios who
OL,17,Fhave defined its look: Studio Moross,
OL,18,FPaul Hemmingfield, Katie Hamill, and
OL,19,FJoab Harrison.
OL,21,FBut the celebration doesn't stop there.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
