PN,36605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786121302
OL,3,CManchester's dance-music institute The
OL,4,CWarehouse Project celebrates 20 years
OL,6,FOver at The Green in St John's
OL,7,Fdistrict, fans can catch the UK
OL,8,Fpremiere of "Twenty Years In
OL,9,FManchester," a short film directed by
OL,10,FLeigh Powis.
OL,12,FScreening daily from 8am to 12pm for
OL,13,Ftwo weeks, the six-minute film
OL,14,Fjourneys through WHP's history,
OL,15,Fcapturing the romance, power, and
OL,16,Fsense of belonging that rave culture
OL,17,Fhas brought to the city.
OL,26,@pD@MOUqD@LO]
