OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786121302
OL,3,CManchester's dance-music institute The
OL,4,CWarehouse Project celebrates 20 years
OL,6,FSince its explosive debut, The
OL,7,FWarehouse Project has united global
OL,8,Felectronic icons with rising talent,
OL,9,Fcementing Manchester's status as a
OL,10,Fworld capital for music lovers.
OL,12,FAs WHP looks back on twenty years of
OL,13,Funforgettable nights, the exhibition
OL,14,Finvites everyone to step into the
OL,15,Fstory and celebrate the community,
OL,16,Fcreativity, and enduring magic that
OL,17,Fcontinues to shape Manchester's soul.
OL,19,FKey Information:
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
